mapping "W2330.1" source="W2330" target="35468003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W2330 SNOMED CT 35468003: Swedish ICD-10-SE extension of W23 (Caught, crushed, jammed or
        pinched in or between objects) at idrotts- och sportanläggning (sports and athletics area),
        during idrott, sport, motion (sport/exercise). Target SNOMED CT 4146976 (concept_code 35468003) =
        (Observation/Event, standard_concept=S), the Athena crosswalk target for parent W23. Why this
        target: every SE child of W23 denotes a caught/crushed-in-between-objects event; 4146976 fully
        subsumes the mechanism axis. The place/activity detail has no current standard concept (the
        [X].occurrence-at-. SNOMED CT concepts are all retired invalid_reason=U). Why this tier: moderate:
        best available standard concept, but the target drops two axes of specificity (place and
        activity); the place-specific SNOMED CT equivalents (concept ids 40420594/44801426 (220593009))
        exist but are retired/invalid (invalid_reason=U, valid_end_date 2009/2015), leaving only the
        parent mechanism concept as a standard target.
        """
}
